{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistration:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSData","text":"NSData","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"deviceToken"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"deviceToken","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The device token Data received from APNs","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method from your AppDelegate’s "},{"code":"application:didRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithDeviceToken:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to forward the device token to Pushwoosh."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK normally handles this automatically via method swizzling, but you may need to call","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"this directly if:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’ve disabled swizzling"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’re managing multiple push providers"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You need custom token processing","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Manual token handling with multiple push providers:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ application: UIApplication,","                    didRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithDeviceToken deviceToken: Data) {","","        \/\/ Convert token to string for logging","        let tokenString = deviceToken.map { String(format: \"%02.2hhx\", $0) }.joined()","        Logger.info(\"Received APNs token: \\(tokenString.prefix(20))...\")","","        \/\/ Send to Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.handlePushRegistration(deviceToken)","","        \/\/ Send to other push providers if needed","        FirebaseMessaging.messaging().apnsToken = deviceToken","","        \/\/ Sync with backend","        BackendAPI.shared.updatePushToken(tokenString)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Only use this method if you need manual control.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handlePushRegistration:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"metadata":{"title":"handlePushRegistration:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handlePushRegistration:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"handlePushRegistration:","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"handlePushRegistration:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"abstract":[{"text":"Manually handles the device push token registration.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handlepushregistration:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/handlePushRegistration:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Manually handles the device push token registration."